**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```
Exact match via `==` on each tag (not substring), order preserved by `iter()`.

**`src/main.rs`** — the `list` command now scans for `--tag <TAG>` and `--tag=<TAG>`, then routes through `filter_by_tag`; without a flag it lists all notes as before.

